<title>SPAIN: Spain Paribas absolved, case closed - CNMV.</title>
<headline>Spain Paribas absolved, case closed - CNMV.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's Stock Market Commission CNMV said on Monday it was closing the case on Banque Paribas S.A., having accepted the bank's explanation of events.</p>
<p>In late January, the CNMV opened a probe into Paribas relating to potential share price manipulation on December 27, 1995, when the market slumped late in the trading session.</p>
<p>A case remains open as to Credit Suisse Financial Products, the CNMV said.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
